# Scenario: any boss fought to its defeat (M11.1b, docs/M11_PLAN.md section 22): BOSS (the tools' id: temple2 ..
# last), STEP (the story set up to the step before it, its items given as the scripts give them) and FLAG (the event
# flag its defeat sets) from the environment. The hero armed as the story arms him by then: the Hero Sword given
# (item 97) and handed the ancient sword's ability the game's own way (Event:SetSwordData,
# HandOverSwordAbility -- the castle guard's event). The arena entered the game's way (`boss`), its introduction
# answered, the fight (`devfight`: the game's own ENEMY actors, the boss's parts) until the game sets FLAG, the drops
# collected at once, whatever follows answered; the flags, the player and the session's unprepared pipelines
# (`coverage export`) read. No death (the tools'): a lethal hit leaves one unit of life; everything else is the game's.
# FLAG empty: a fight whose end sets no flag (the priest's second) -- fought until no enemy is left (its check: where
# its after-event takes the hero). FIGHT_MODE (optional): hold@X,Z -- a boss that comes to the hero (the kraken) fought
# from that spot; INVULNERABLE=on
# (optional): the hero never hurt, so his life stays full and his sword's full-life beam reaches across water.
#   BOSS=temple2 STEP=10 FLAG=11 SCENARIO=devtools_bossfight ... tests/boot_smoke.py   (tests/devtools_bosses.py)
#! saves build/checkpoints/castle-front
#! env DOTHEROES_DEVELOPER_MODE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0 SHOT_EVERY=20
#! secs 3300

include common.drive

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state life>0,area==17 90
sleep 3
dev nodeath on
dev invulnerable ${INVULNERABLE:-off}
dev progress set ${STEP}
dev give 97
loop 4                        # the item-get's message
  press CROSS
  sleep 1
end
dev lua local E=EventClass.Event; E:SetSwordData(); E:HandOverSwordAbility(swordData.SwordData.SL_HERO_SWORD, swordData.SwordData.SL_ANTIQUITY_SWORD)
dev player
dev flags 0 330
dev boss ${BOSS} @150
sleep 2
shot arena
devpage 420 ${PAGE:-}         # the introduction, answered to its end (at the castle the priest first beats the hero down)
shot fight
segment fight ${BOSS} to its defeat
devfight 2700 flag${FLAG} ${FIGHT_MODE:-}
endseg
shot defeated
devcollect 120
loop 20                       # the defeat's own event
  press CROSS
  sleep 1.5
end
devcollect 30
sleep 3
shot after
dev flags 0 330
dev player
dev status
dev coverage
dev coverage export boss-${BOSS}
